     1352        "ПОИСК ПО" VIEW-AS TEXT
     1353             SIZE 8.4 BY 1 AT ROW 16.27 COL 1
     1354             FGCOLOR 4
     1355        SPACE(89.09) SKIP(4.30)
     1356       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     1357            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
     1358            TITLE "История остатков товара на объекте"
     1359            DEFAULT-BUTTON b-exit.
     1360   ASSIGN
     1361          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     1362          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
     1363   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
